{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A survival game first\u00a0and foremost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main objective in Rocket Hit is to survive, not the horrible aliens, but rather the numerous asteroids that detach from their belts to strike directly at the fuselage of your rocket, so you have to be attentive at all times, without ending up charred by a star, destroyed by an asteroid, swept into the vacuum of space by a comet or swallowed by a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/extras/GIF-1.gif?t=1742652009\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A unique atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an incomparable atmosphere in star systems each denser than the last, get up close to each planet and star and feel the immensity of the stars and space. With total immersion, relax in orbit on Rocket Hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/extras/GIF-3.gif?t=1742652009\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A realistic physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The physics of the game's orbits are realistic, providing a simple understanding of orbital physics, even greater immersion, exclusive and innovative gameplay, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/extras/GIF-4.gif?t=1742652009\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A world on a smaller scale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll notice that the game's scale is far from realistic, allowing you to experience a game with such physics first-hand, but also simplifying exploration and action by giving the game a cartoonish complexion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/extras/GIF-2.gif?t=1742652009\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complete cosmetics customization and much more</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a diverse range of star systems and explore them aboard mythical rockets, recreated almost identically, instantly available when you download the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425310?t=1742652009","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3425310?t=1742652009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/9ba6511dbf49009419c71769a831196fd9e1de46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742652009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/9ba6511dbf49009419c71769a831196fd9e1de46/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742652009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A survival game first\u00a0and foremost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main objective in Rocket Hit is to survive, not the horrible aliens, but rather the numerous asteroids that detach from their belts to strike directly at the fuselage of your rocket, so you have to be attentive at all times, without ending up charred by a star, destroyed by an asteroid, swept into the vacuum of space by a comet or swallowed by a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425310/extras/GIF-1.gif?t=1742652009\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A unique atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an incomparable atmosphere in star systems each denser than the last, get up close to each planet and star and feel the imm